# Local env overrides. NOTE: .env itself is intentionally committed — it holds
# only the Supabase publishable (anon) keys, which ship to the browser anyway,
# and the Vercel build inlines VITE_* from it at build time. Never put a
# service-role key or any other secret in .env — use .env.local (ignored here)
# for local secrets, and the Vercel dashboard for deployed ones.
.env.local
.env.*.local

